 we're looking for\n \n\n\n\n 1\u20133 years of hands\\-on experience running paid campaigns (agency or in\\-house, both work)\n \n\n\n\n Solid understanding of Meta Ads Manager \u2014 campaign structure, targeting, creative testing, and attribution\n \n\n\n\n Working knowledge of Google Ads (Search, PMax, YouTube) and LinkedIn Campaign Manager\n \n\n\n\n Experience with lead generation campaigns \u2014 you understand CPL, lead quality, and funnel thinking\n \n\n\n\n Comfortable with GA4 and basic pixel/event tracking setup\n \n\n\n\n Strong with data \u2014 you can read a dashboard and know what to do next\n \n\n\n\n Clear communicator \u2014 written and verbal"},{"title":"Bridal Fashion Stylist  NIFT","company":"Team Amrit Kaur Artistry","location":"Delhi","date_posted":"2026-08-20","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/bridal-fashion-stylist-nift-job-in-delhi-at-team-amrit-kaur-artistry1787185878","experience":"2 year(s)"},{"title":"Google PPC & Meta Ads Specialist (Evening Shift)","company":"ICONIER Digital Marketing Agency","location":"Delhi","date_posted":"2026-08-21","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/google-ppc-meta-ads-specialist-evening-shift-job-in-delhi-at-iconier-digital-marketing-agency1787297483","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Administrative Officer","company":"TERI School Of Advanced Studies","location":"Delhi","date_posted":"2026-08-21","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/administrative-officer-job-in-delhi-at-teri-school-of-advanced-studies1787297480","experience":"5 year(s)"},{"title":"Structural Design Engineer","company":"CP Kukreja Architects","location":"Delhi","date_posted":"2026-08-21","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/structural-design-engineer-job-in-delhi-at-cp-kukreja-architects1787297479","experience":"3 year(s)"},{"title":"Customer Service Associate","company":"Moretasks Business Solution Limited","location":"Delhi","date_posted":"2026-08-21","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/customer-service-assoc